{% block brandDescription %}
      <p class="brand-description">Kramer Guitars is an American manufacturer that rose to prominence in the 1980s as the leading brand in hard rock and heavy metal guitars, largely due to its innovative use of high-performance features like Floyd Rose tremolos and a key endorsement deal with Eddie Van Halen. The company is currently a division of the Gibson Guitar Corporation.<br><a href="#" class="decoder-howto-link" data-modal-target="howto-kramer">(How to decode a Kramer serial #)</a></p>
